Vikram and Betal: The True Friend

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Two friends were traveling together,” said Betal. “They promised to always help each other.”

One day, they were walking through a forest when they saw a bear coming towards them.

The first friend quickly climbed a tree and hid.

The second friend did not know how to climb.

He quickly lay down on the ground and held his breath, pretending to be dead.

The bear came close, sniffed him, and went away.

After the bear left, the first friend came down from the tree.

He asked, “What did the bear whisper in your ear?”

The second friend replied, “The bear told me not to trust a friend who leaves you in danger.”

Betal then asked Vikram, “Who was the true friend?”

Vikram answered, “The second friend was wiser, but the first one was not a true friend.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

A true friend stays with you in difficult times.
